### Collection
GET http://localhost:8000/api/films
Accept: application/json

### Collection recherchée et paginée
GET http://localhost:8000/api/films?q=alien&page=1&limite=2
Accept: application/json

### Ressource existante
GET http://localhost:8000/api/films/1
Accept: application/json

### Ressource absente : 404
GET http://localhost:8000/api/films/9999
Accept: application/json

### Création : 201 et en-tête Location
POST http://localhost:8000/api/films
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "titre": "Metropolis",
  "annee": 1927,
  "note": 8.3
}

### Création invalide : 422
POST http://localhost:8000/api/films
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "titre": " ",
  "annee": 1800,
  "note": 14
}

### Modification partielle
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/films/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "note": 9.1
}

### Suppression : 204 et corps vide
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/films/2
Accept: application/json
